A1707 820-00928 (but 820-00281 has the same problems) Problem: No power, the machine was taking 20V and 0.014A, PP1V8_SUS shorted Solution: In this case PCH and PMIC to do. Usually if the board is taking 20V and 0.01A ~ 0.025A there is a problem with some of the PMIC's voltages.